--- !u!114 &723659866
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 723659864}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe61c457b009a094792c22a0fd01b2a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CinematicTrigger
  playerCam: {fileID: 1280946466}
  objectiveCam: {fileID: 345019829}
  speakerName: Bear
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a884dcc436b1e9a45918b680aefcc697, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "\"Tumor Roots Document...\" These things\u2026 they actually have a name."
  - "Tumor Roots\u2026 according to this report, they spread underground before breaking
    through the surface."
  - "\"They grow fast\u2026 and they don\u2019t stop.\""
  - "\"Infection Report: Infection spreads through direct exposure to contaminated
    growths and bodily fluids\u2026\""
  - "\u201CSymptoms include aggression, violent twitching, tissue mutation, and loss
    of higher cognitive function.\""
  - '"Mutant Classification Document..." They actually categorized these things.

'
  - "\u201CType: Basic Mutant\nBehavior: Spreads the infection.\""
  - "\u201CType: Male Mutant\nBehavior: Throws chunks of debris at you. Hands and
    arms are so disfigured where they can be used as a blunt weapon.\""
  - "\u201CType: Female Mutant\nBehavior: Uses an ear-piercing voice to summon a
    swarm of Special Mutants.\""
  - "\u201CType: Special Mutant\nBehavior:  Acts as eyes for the Female Mutant.\""
  - "\"Tumor Report...\" The smaller tumors are formed when the roots bunch together\u2026"
  - "\"Central Tumor Mass Report...\" This is that Giant Tumor down there... the
    report says it acts like a heart\u2026 or a nest."
  - "If the Giant Tumor isn\u2019t destroyed\u2026the infection will keep spreading."
  playOnlyOnce: 1
  sceneLoader: {fileID: 0}
  loadNextSceneAfterDialogue: 0
  playerAttack: {fileID: 0}
  showTutorialAfterDialogue: 0
  tutorialStepID: 
  tutorialText: 
